{"step_index":1258,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T17:13:40Z","content":"Tracking **\"Appointments Set\"** as the core success metric aligns the workflow with our ultimate objective (locking in verified classroom sit-downs).\n\n---\n\n### 🎯 What Has Been Implemented\n\n1. **Dedicated 1-Tap `🎯 Appt. Set` Disposition ([`DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx)):**\n   - Featured prominently with a Heavenly Gold glowing border.\n   - **Smart Confirmation Modal**: Opens pre-populated with the teacher's requested planning period or preferred time window.\n   - Saves confirmed date, time, and classroom room number with the disposition `'appointment_set'`.\n   - **`💬 Spoke / Connected`** remains available for conversations where a final meeting date wasn't finalized yet.\n\n2. **Core KPI Dashboard Strip & Filtering ([`ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **Top KPI Cards**: Displays **Educators**, **To Call**, **Appts Set** (highlighted in gold), and **Callbacks**.\n   - **Filter Tabs**: Filter by **All**, **To Call**, **Appts Set**, **Callbacks**, and **Unanswered**.\n   - **Status Badge**: Educator cards display a **`🎯 Appt. Set`** badge when booked.\n\n3. **Analytics & Performance Tracking ([`AnalyticsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/AnalyticsScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **Hero Metric Card**: **APPOINTMENT SET RATE** (`%` of dials converted to booked sit-downs).\n   - **Outcome Breakdown**: Displays Total Dials, Appointments Set, Connected / Spoke, Unanswered / Voicemails, and Follow-Up SMS texts sent.\n   - **Session Finish Screen**: When a calling block concludes, your total **Dials Completed**, **Appointments Set**, and **Callbacks Scheduled** are summarized in a high-contrast card.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Production Deployment Live\nThe updated build is live and ready on Surge:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**"}
